  "details": "I have many friends so I have group of friends I want to join on more, so just friends im closer too. \nScrolling thro Friend Locations to find them is pain as there is a lot of locations to join to. \nAt the same time after merging all my groups into one, I still can't use my VIP group to join on people because I don't know who of them is in a world i can/want to join.\nSo I see 2 possible solutions here: \nOne is to edit the friend list design to include some short world name in there. \nSecond is to add group sorting (or grouping by) to Friend Locations, so I can see my fav friends first.\nPreffarably both would be the best.",
